# ---------------- 127.97 Building Maintenance Electrical / HVAC ----------------
H('97.d.1.A',3,"During electrical maintenance, the first step before touching wires is to:","Turn off and lock out the power",["Test with a wet hand","Leave it energized","Remove your PPE"],"Lockout/tagout protects workers.")
H('97.d.1.A',4,"Before working on a light fixture, test the circuit with a:","Voltage tester",["Hammer","Tape measure","Level"],"Verify the power is off.")
